      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, upper margin",
          "value": "<p>whether as yet you had the opportunity to get it. As for myself, I will not, God willing, tarry here after \u1e24an\u016bkka. Thanks to ... God willing. I have informed you of this. If you have the opportunity, I would like you to [obtain beads] of good quality for a dinar and a quarter ... for 5 or approximately for that sum. Take a thousand of them for me of good quality .... If you also have the opportunity, [obtain for me pairs of] sandaIs; by this you will be doing me a favor.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
